    {
      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The Guild Wars 2 Wiki has an article on Grand Court of Sebelkeh.",
        "The world map actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the Grand Court of Sebelkeh mission, which is Pledge of the Merchant Princes. On the raised platform are two glowing circles with signposts that resemble floor portals. They seem to hint that they can teleport characters into the Sebelkeh Basilica but in actuality, they are nothing but decorations. Grand Court of Sebelkeh, Tihark Orchard, The Mouth of Torment, Yahnur Market, Brauer Academy, Piken Square (pre-Searing), Sifhalla, and Tarnished Haven are the only outposts with two exits leading to the same zone.",
        "Anomaly. The quest marker will always point out of the east exit, even if heading out the west exit would be nearer to the next quest trigger.",
        "Towns and outposts in Vabbi The Kodash Bazaar • Basalt Grotto • Chantry of Secrets • Dasha Vestibule • Dzagonur Bastion • Grand Court of Sebelkeh • Honur Hill • Jennur's Horde • Mihanu Township • Tihark Orchard • Yahnur Market Missions • Explorable areas • Landmarks"
      ]
    }
