  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/c4/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh.jpg/196px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/c/c4/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e5/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg/196px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"174\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e5/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg/294px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e5/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg/392px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"733\" data-file-height=\"652\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/00/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg/196px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/00/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg/294px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/00/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg/392px-Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>Gateway to the wondrous Basilica, the Grand Court overlooks the reflecting pool that gives <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">the Mirror of Lyss</a> its name. From here, one may ascend to the floating <a href=\"/wiki/Sebelkeh_Basilica\" title=\"Sebelkeh Basilica\">Sebelkeh Basilica</a> itself, the most ornate and magical temple in <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elona</a>, and the heart of the <a href=\"/wiki/Lyssa\" title=\"Lyssa\">Lyssan</a> faith.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Grand Court of Sebelkeh</b> is the entrance to the renowned central place of worship to <a href=\"/wiki/Lyssa\" title=\"Lyssa\">Lyssa</a> in all of <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Warning_Kehanni\" title=\"Warning Kehanni\">Warning Kehanni</a> concludes here. That quest only comes a while after your initial arrival in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">the Mirror of Lyss</a>. This outpost can be located earlier by going north and around the large central lake.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a> (east and west)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Head_Priest_Vahmani\" title=\"Head Priest Vahmani\">Head Priest Vahmani</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Calling_the_Order\" title=\"Calling the Order\">Calling the Order</a> <img alt=\"Primary quest\" src=\"/images/6/68/Tango-quest-icon-primary.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Primary quest\" width=\"10\" height=\"19\" data-file-width=\"10\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a> <img alt=\"Primary quest\" src=\"/images/6/68/Tango-quest-icon-primary.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Primary quest\" width=\"10\" height=\"19\" data-file-width=\"10\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Zojan\" title=\"Zojan\">Zojan</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Yuli\" title=\"Yuli\">Yuli</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Skill_trainer\" title=\"Skill trainer\">skill trainer</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Haitend\" title=\"Haitend\">Haitend</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Head_Priest_Vahmani\" title=\"Head Priest Vahmani\">Head Priest Vahmani</a> (mission access)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Scout\" title=\"Zaishen Scout\">Zaishen Scout</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #D16E5A; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 0.9em; background: #F9F9F9;\" cellspacing=\"3\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\"><img alt=\"Gw2logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/41px-Gw2logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/61px-Gw2logo.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/81px-Gw2logo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"692\" data-file-height=\"479\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>The <a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\">Guild Wars 2 Wiki</a>  has an article on <i><b><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a></b></i>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/Pledge_of_the_Merchant_Princes\" title=\"Pledge of the Merchant Princes\">Pledge of the Merchant Princes</a>.</li>\n<li>On the raised platform are two glowing circles with signposts that resemble floor portals. They seem to hint that they can teleport characters into the <a href=\"/wiki/Sebelkeh_Basilica\" title=\"Sebelkeh Basilica\">Sebelkeh Basilica</a> but in actuality, they are nothing but decorations.</li>\n<li>Grand Court of Sebelkeh, <a href=\"/wiki/Tihark_Orchard_(outpost)\" title=\"Tihark Orchard (outpost)\">Tihark Orchard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mouth_of_Torment\" title=\"The Mouth of Torment\">The Mouth of Torment</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Yahnur_Market\" title=\"Yahnur Market\">Yahnur Market</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Brauer_Academy\" title=\"Brauer Academy\">Brauer Academy</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Piken_Square_(pre-Searing)\" title=\"Piken Square (pre-Searing)\">Piken Square (pre-Searing)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sifhalla\" title=\"Sifhalla\">Sifhalla</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Haven\" title=\"Tarnished Haven\">Tarnished Haven</a> are the only outposts with two exits leading to the same zone.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 7.5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -7.3em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Anomaly.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Anomaly\"><img alt=\"Anomaly\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/18px-Anomaly.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/27px-Anomaly.png 1.5x, /images/a/a6/Anomaly.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Anomaly\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anomaly\">Anomaly</a>.</strong> The quest marker will always point out of the east exit, even if heading out the west exit would be nearer to the next quest trigger.</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Vabbi\">Towns and outposts in Vabbi</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Kodash_Bazaar\" title=\"The Kodash Bazaar\">The Kodash Bazaar</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basalt_Grotto\" title=\"Basalt Grotto\">Basalt Grotto</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chantry_of_Secrets\" title=\"Chantry of Secrets\">Chantry of Secrets</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule (outpost)\">Dasha Vestibule</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion (outpost)\">Dzagonur Bastion</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Honur_Hill\" title=\"Honur Hill\">Honur Hill</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde (outpost)\">Jennur's Horde</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mihanu_Township\" title=\"Mihanu Township\">Mihanu Township</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tihark_Orchard_(outpost)\" title=\"Tihark Orchard (outpost)\">Tihark Orchard</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yahnur_Market\" title=\"Yahnur Market\">Yahnur Market</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Missions\" title=\"Vabbi\">Missions</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Explorable_areas\" title=\"Vabbi\">Explorable areas</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Landmarks\" title=\"Vabbi\">Landmarks</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009132807\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 939/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9366/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1544/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.431      1 -total\n 52.00%   32.982      1 Template:Location_disambiguation_2\n 26.56%   16.849      8 Template:Ifexists\n 14.94%    9.477      1 Template:Location_infobox\n  4.02%    2.553      1 Template:W\n  3.46%    2.197      8 Template:Profession_icon_sizes\n  3.27%    2.076      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  2.65%    1.683      1 Template:Quotation\n  2.52%    1.600      1 Template:Me\n  2.50%    1.584      2 Template:Quest_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:8928-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009132807 and revision id 2730656.\n -->\n</div>"
